{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026qB6lSDBLVW1794475160.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>海關偵破一宗遠洋船走私案，檢獲大量走私瀕危物種貨物，約值一億元。<br/></p><p>行動檢獲大量鯊魚翅、鯊魚皮，鱷魚皮、海馬等。海關經情報分析及風險評估，上月24日檢查4個原定運往韓國，報稱載有海鮮的貨櫃，在內發現大批走私貨物。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.SMUGGLING-1600-1_CLEAN_20261112_163239_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20267hCQW5rcsg1794475168.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>海關指走私受管制瀕危物種屬嚴重罪行，任何人違反《保護瀕危動植物物種條例》，最高可罰1,000萬元及監禁10年。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T10:24:06.922835+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":161,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T09:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T13:17:26.547785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T10:17:28.686980+00:00","content_hash":"806e0fe4d228acd4a565f140c093eb59c0bb0f06d48e8dca026950108debd045","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}